{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01490","headline":"舞曲歌辞 白紵辞三首 一 · 李白","name":"舞曲歌辞 白紵辞三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扬清歌，发皓齿，北方佳人东邻子。\n且吟白紵停渌水，长袖拂面爲君起。\n寒云夜卷霜海空，胡风吹天飘塞鸿。\n玉颜满堂乐未终，馆娃日落歌吹蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}